WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.818
The Manage All Inventory page helps you maintain buyable, discoverable, and high-quality listings

00:00:09.818 --> 00:00:11.220
across marketplaces.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:18.866
To access the page from Seller Central, open the main menu, hover over Inventory, and select Manage

00:00:18.866 --> 00:00:19.700
All Inventory.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:26.677
This page displays each of your listing status, product details, performance, inventory, price and

00:00:26.677 --> 00:00:29.140
shipping cost, and estimated fees.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.080
The listing status column indicates if a listing is active.

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:39.460
If a listing has a recommended action, you can click on it to fix issues and improve performance.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:47.060
Use the search bar to find listings by ASIN, SKU, or product name, and apply filters to narrow results.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:52.760
To customize your view, click the gear icon to set default layouts and filters.

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:59.825
You can add new products or new product variations using the add products or add variation buttons

00:00:59.825 --> 00:01:01.520
in the top right corner.

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:07.420
Manage individual listings using the three vertical dots to the right of each listing.

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:13.906
For more ways to manage your business, access the listing and FBA inventory tools located at the

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:15.300
top of the page.
